paragraph\" >CATS: You can pet them. Cats bonded to you join you in your dreams, guiding your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE SHADOW OVER INNSMOUTH: This game draws inspiration from H.P. Lovecraft's Cthulhu mythos. In the original tale, there are no cats  in Innsmouth, making this one of the few deviations in the game. However, the narrative overall stays true to the spirit of the source material, free from any silly references or anachronisms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143760/extras/3d27af8585d43fcc768fdfca98239d25.poster.avif?t=1733698026\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143760/extras/3d27af8585d43fcc768fdfca98239d25.webm?t=1733698026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
